    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme bana ba Amono ba bona gore ba ile ba baba go Dafida, gomme Khanune le bana ba Amono ba romela dikhitšana tše sekete tša silibera go hira ⟨go bona⟩ go tšwa go Arama-Naharayime, Arama-Maakha le Tsohoba, dikoloi tša ntoa le balaodi ba dipitse.",
